WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.535
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.836
We hope you're all doing well

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.805
and now, we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:09.409
President Biden was caught
on a hot microphone yesterday

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:12.812
referring to Fox News reporter
Peter Doocy

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.215
as "a stupid son of a bitch."

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:16.349
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.685
Said Biden, "I am so sorry.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.086
That was supposed to be

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.721
into the main mic."

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.857
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.993
After he was caught referring
to Fox News reporter Peter Doocy

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:29.395
as "a stupid son of a bitch,"

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:32.965
President Biden reportedly
called Doocy to clear the air

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:34.667
and, just like
Biden being elected,

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.669
Doocy's going to pretend
it never happened.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.037
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:40.239
And, to me, the crazy part
of all this

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:41.707
isn't that Biden got mad

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:43.376
that Doocy tried
to make him look bad.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.544
It's that Biden was so surprised

00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:47.613
that Doocy tried
to make him look bad.

00:00:47.613 --> 00:00:48.781
Where you been, dude?

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:49.882
[ Laughter ]
That's the game.

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:51.551
Biden's like that kid
in fourth grade

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.119
who wanted to play dodgeball

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:55.822
and then got super mad that
someone whipped a ball at him.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:57.857
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:02.695
As tensions increase
between the U.S. and Russia,

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:05.498
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki warned yesterday

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.366
that American citizens
in Ukraine

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:08.868
should leave the country now,

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:11.704
but added that no organized
evacuation is planned.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.140
Why is that, because of the
last one you organized?

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.209
[ Audience ohs ]

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:18.611
We'd love to help out!

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:19.913
"We're good!"

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:21.314
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:24.950
Just going to go on Expedia,
thank you.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:27.420
Yesterday marked the start
of tax season,

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.721
for those who celebrate.

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:30.757
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.794
NASA announced yesterday

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:38.198
that the world's largest
and most powerful telescope

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:39.899
has reached its observation post

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:42.668
and is now one million miles
away from Earth.

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:44.003
Must be nice.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.338
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.338 --> 00:01:47.807
Hilton announced yesterday

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:50.142
that its Homewood Suites chain
of hotels

00:01:50.142 --> 00:01:52.745
is now 100% pet-friendly,

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.280
while Days Inn announced

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.250
they have enough animals
to worry about.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.285
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.787 --> 00:02:04.691
It's nice to see two raccoons
and a snake getting along.

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:07.760
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.395
It's an uneasy peace!

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.363
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.363 --> 00:02:13.833
Krispy Kreme will offer
a dozen free doughnuts

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.669
to anyone who donates blood,
amid a national shortage.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:19.438
Tough break for anyone
who drank it already.

00:02:19.438 --> 00:02:21.474
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:26.012
Guys are out a dozen doughnuts.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.313
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.415
And, finally, a couple in India
recently announced

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:31.517
that they will have their
wedding in the metaverse

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:33.253
and have invited 2,000 people.

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:34.453
It's the perfect way to say,

00:02:34.453 --> 00:02:36.723
"We don't want our grandparents
to come."

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:39.658
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.658 --> 00:02:41.361
"It's in the what?!"

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:42.895
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.895 --> 00:02:44.764
And that was the monologue,
everybody!

